      },
      "meaning": "but; used to show a different idea",
      "example": "It was raining. However, we went out.",
      "exampleMeaning": {
        "hi": "बारिश हो रही थी। फिर भी, हम बाहर गए।",
        "hinglish": "Baarish ho rahi thi. Phir bhi, hum baahar gaye."
      }
    },
